      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1728000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Brain order (cannot skip):  session  \u2192  rate limit  \u2192  firewall  \u2192  keyword router (Gemini only if keywords miss)  \u2192  lane\nLanes: refuse  \u00b7  ask (missing detail)  \u00b7  read  \u00b7  write (one step)  \u00b7  chain (\u22648 steps)  \u00b7  lever\n\nRead  \u2014  \u201cWhat's my health factor?\u201d  MCP vanna_account.health \u2192 Gemini may reword numbers, never invent them.\nWrite \u2014  \u201cSupply 100 USDC\u201d  MCP builds unsigned v0 tx + simulates \u2192 preview \u2192 wallet signs \u2192 lib/solana confirms.\nPlan  \u2014  \u201cLever my SOL 2x\u201d  server stores digest-bound steps (5 min). Each step: claim-once \u2192 fresh 1.15 check \u2192 rebuild \u2192 sign \u2192 confirm.",
      "originalText": "Brain order (cannot skip):  session  \u2192  rate limit  \u2192  firewall  \u2192  keyword router (Gemini only if keywords miss)  \u2192  lane\nLanes: refuse  \u00b7  ask (missing detail)  \u00b7  read  \u00b7  write (one step)  \u00b7  chain (\u22648 steps)  \u00b7  lever\n\nRead  \u2014  \u201cWhat's my health factor?\u201d  MCP vanna_account.health \u2192 Gemini may reword numbers, never invent them.\nWrite \u2014  \u201cSupply 100 USDC\u201d  MCP builds unsigned v0 tx + simulates \u2192 preview \u2192 wallet signs \u2192 lib/solana confirms.\nPlan  \u2014  \u201cLever my SOL 2x\u201d  server stores digest-bound steps (5 min). Each step: claim-once \u2192 fresh 1.15 check \u2192 rebuild \u2192 sign \u2192 confirm.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
